        {
          "ruleId": "sunset/sql_injection",
          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "058_05.php 登录查询 username 参数 SQL 注入（CWE-89）\n\n攻击者通过 HTTP 请求的 query 参数 `username`（058_05.php:25 读取）提交输入，该值未经任何转义或参数化即被拼接进 058_05.php:30 的 `$sql = \"select count(*) from users where username='$username'\"`，随后在 058_05.php:31 交给 `mysql_query($sql)` 执行。由于单引号包裹的字符串上下文未做 `mysql_real_escape_string` 或预处理绑定，攻击者可闭合引号注入任意 SQL 片段（如 `' OR '1'='1` 或 UNION 子查询），校验完全缺失。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "058_05.php"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 29,
                  "endLine": 31
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "sunsetFindingId": "GEN-b07a62da291f"
          },
          "properties": {
            "finding_id": "GEN-b07a62da291f",
            "confidence": 0.78,
            "verdict": "candidate",
            "evidence_level": "rule_verified+llm",
            "cwe": "CWE-89",
            "endpoint": "/058_05",
            "http_method": "ANY",
            "has_poc": true,
            "origin": "rule"
          }
        },
        {
          "ruleId": "sunset/sql_injection",
          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "058_05.php 用户注册 INSERT 语句 SQL 注入（CWE-89）\n\n攻击者通过 query 参数 `username`（058_05.php:25 读取，同时 `$pass` 亦来自请求）提交输入，在注册分支中被直接拼入 058_05.php:48 的 `$sql = \"insert into users ( username, password) values(\\\"$username\\\", \\\"$pass\\\")\"`，并在 058_05.php:49 由 `mysql_query($sql)` 执行。双引号包裹的 VALUES 上下文未做任何转义，攻击者可用 `\\\"` 闭合后追加任意 SQL，或利用报错信息（`mysql_error()` 被回显）辅助注入。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "058_05.php"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 47,
                  "endLine": 49
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "sunsetFindingId": "GEN-7923d3edceea"
          },
          "properties": {
            "finding_id": "GEN-7923d3edceea",
            "confidence": 0.78,
            "verdict": "candidate",
            "evidence_level": "rule_verified+llm",
            "cwe": "CWE-89",
            "endpoint": "/058_05",
            "http_method": "ANY",
            "has_poc": true,
            "origin": "rule"
          }
        },
        {
          "ruleId": "sunset/sql_injection",
          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "058_08.php 修改口令 UPDATE 语句 SQL 注入（CWE-89）\n\n攻击者在修改口令流程中通过 query 参数 `current_password`（058_08.php:32 读取，`$pass`、`$username` 同样来自请求）提交输入，被直接拼入 058_08.php:38 的 `$sql = \"UPDATE users SET PASSWORD='$pass' where username='$username' and password='$curr_pass' \"`，并在 058_08.php:39 由 `mysql_query($sql)` 执行。WHERE 子句中的 `$curr_pass` 与 SET 中的 `$pass` 均未转义，攻击者可用 `' OR '1'='1` 使 WHERE 恒真，从而在不知道原口令的情况下改写任意用户口令。"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "058_08.php"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 37,
                  "endLine": 39
